{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobgLxl4E.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『コインランドリー』"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVが公開されました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうご覧になりましたか？👀"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobypFx5x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "世界観も衣装もセットも全部素敵☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobxj97jJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobom7U3F.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobT4xIMC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobIHd8ZE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラ覗き込んでる☺︎"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "微笑ましい。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobWvmxrJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふふっ📸"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きれいだね、ゆったーん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobdmpl5I.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobrNGm0p.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なにこの笑顔〜。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいいいいいい"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobecHqkq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "練習してる。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいっ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobEfby0c.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob87Gcwh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ラスサビでみんなが踊ってるところを"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モニターで見てる時、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなの可愛すぎる笑顔に心が浄化されていました🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モヤモヤした気持ちも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「どうでもいいや〜」って！！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なにか嫌なことがあったときに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このMVを見てみよう、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ってそんな風にみんなの心を浄化できる存在になったらいいな〜☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob7lOh2h.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobzI9z7x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これ美味しいよーって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "教えてくれるかわいいきらさん。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちゃんと食べました、美味しかったです☕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きらさんが隣にいてくださって心強いです☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobR8g9dN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のブログはここまで！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "28日の20時から、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "SHOWROOM配信をやろうと思うのでぜひきてください🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね！"}], "source": "official"}